127
00:09:57,230 --> 00:10:00,890
The output can be a deliverable or an
outcome.

128
00:10:01,490 --> 00:10:03,730
Outcomes are an end result of a process.

129
00:10:04,430 --> 00:10:08,750
Project management processes apply
globally across industries.

130
00:10:09,470 --> 00:10:14,330
Project management processes are logically
linked by the outputs they produce.

131
00:10:14,670 --> 00:10:19,424
