141
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:12,330
The process conduct procurements is
performed prior to needing the procured item.

142
00:11:12,830 --> 00:11:16,390
Processes that are performed continually
throughout the project.

143
00:11:17,090 --> 00:11:21,910
The process define activity may occur
throughout the project lifecycle,

144
00:11:22,790 --> 00:11:27,470
especially if the project uses rolling
wave planning or an adaptive development

